<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="drop dead"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Olivia Rodrigo"/><amll:meta key="album" value="you seem pretty sad for a girl so in love"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3370511577"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0019pnwy4MlXc0"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="6gkbtMtioHgtyGjrMel6ei"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUG12601721"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="142093212"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="iiiooi"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:42.017"><div begin="00:15.178" end="03:42.017"><p begin="00:15.178" end="00:20.042" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:15.178" end="00:15.625">I</span> <span begin="00:15.625" end="00:16.072">know</span> <span begin="00:16.072" end="00:16.382">that</span> <span begin="00:16.382" end="00:16.658">the</span> <span begin="00:16.658" end="00:17.155">bar</span> <span begin="00:17.155" end="00:17.931">closes</span> <span begin="00:17.931" end="00:18.402">at</span> <span begin="00:18.402" end="00:20.042">11</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道酒吧在十一点关门</span></p><p begin="00:22.232" end="00:27.621" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:22.232" end="00:22.527">But</span> <span begin="00:22.527" end="00:22.975">I</span> <span begin="00:22.975" end="00:23.399">hope</span> <span begin="00:23.399" end="00:23.789">you</span> <span begin="00:23.789" end="00:24.485">never</span> <span begin="00:24.485" end="00:25.511">finish</span> <span begin="00:25.511" end="00:25.959">that</span> <span begin="00:25.959" end="00:27.621">beer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我希望你永远别喝完那杯啤酒</span></p><p begin="00:29.919" end="00:34.799" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:29.919" end="00:30.376">You</span> <span begin="00:30.376" end="00:30.766">know</span> <span begin="00:30.766" end="00:31.179">all</span> <span begin="00:31.179" end="00:31.466">the</span> <span begin="00:31.466" end="00:32.062">words</span> <span begin="00:32.062" end="00:32.424">to</span> <span begin="00:32.424" end="00:32.781">"Just</span> <span begin="00:32.781" end="00:33.281">Like</span> <span begin="00:33.281" end="00:33.611">Hea</span><span begin="00:33.611" end="00:34.799">ven"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你对《Just Like Heaven》的歌词了如指掌</span></p><p begin="00:35.229" end="00:37.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:35.229" end="00:35.477">And</span> <span begin="00:35.477" end="00:35.871">I</span> <span begin="00:35.871" end="00:36.136">know</span> <span begin="00:36.136" end="00:36.519">why</span> <span begin="00:36.519" end="00:37.022">he</span> <span begin="00:37.022" end="00:37.462">wrote</span> <span begin="00:37.462" end="00:37.943">them</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我也终于明白了作者写下它们的心境</span></p><p begin="00:37.943" end="00:43.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:37.943" end="00:38.445">Now</span> <span begin="00:38.445" end="00:38.915">that</span> <span begin="00:38.915" end="00:39.285">you're</span> <span begin="00:39.285" end="00:40.325">standing</span> <span begin="00:40.325" end="00:40.773">right</span> <span begin="00:40.773" end="00:43.270">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而现在，你就站在我面前</span></p><p begin="00:43.758" end="00:47.918" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:43.758" end="00:44.753">Oh,</span> <span begin="00:44.753" end="00:45.154">one</span> <span begin="00:45.154" end="00:45.515">night</span> <span begin="00:45.515" end="00:46.030">I</span> <span begin="00:46.030" end="00:46.446">was</span> <span begin="00:46.446" end="00:46.936">bored</span> <span begin="00:46.936" end="00:47.404">in</span> <span begin="00:47.404" end="00:47.918">bed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哦，有天晚上我无聊地躺在床上</span></p><p begin="00:47.918" end="00:51.631" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:47.918" end="00:48.178">And</span> <span begin="00:48.178" end="00:48.794">stalked</span> <span begin="00:48.794" end="00:49.233">you</span> <span begin="00:49.233" end="00:49.703">on</span> <span begin="00:49.703" end="00:50.208">the</span> <span begin="00:50.208" end="00:50.596">in</span><span begin="00:50.596" end="00:51.151">ter</span><span begin="00:51.151" end="00:51.631">net</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在互联网上偷偷翻看你的动态</span></p><p begin="00:51.631" end="00:55.228" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:51.631" end="00:52.030">It's</span> <span begin="00:52.030" end="00:52.440">f</span><span begin="00:52.440" end="00:52.938">emi</span><span begin="00:52.938" end="00:53.399">nine</span> <span begin="00:53.399" end="00:53.813">in</span><span begin="00:53.813" end="00:54.423">tui</span><span begin="00:54.423" end="00:55.228">tion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是女人的直觉在作祟</span></p><p begin="00:55.228" end="00:59.072" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:55.228" end="00:55.552">'Cause</span> <span begin="00:55.552" end="00:55.741">I</span> <span begin="00:55.741" end="00:56.182">always</span> <span begin="00:56.182" end="00:56.425">had</span> <span begin="00:56.425" end="00:56.664">a</span> <span begin="00:56.664" end="00:57.102">vision</span> <span begin="00:57.102" end="00:57.347">of</span> <span begin="00:57.347" end="00:57.502">us</span> <span begin="00:57.502" end="00:57.939">standing</span> <span begin="00:57.939" end="00:58.370">like</span> <span begin="00:58.370" end="00:59.072">this</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我脑海中总浮现出我们此刻站在一起的画面</span></p><p begin="00:59.072" end="01:02.592" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:59.072" end="00:59.417">All</span> <span begin="00:59.417" end="00:59.947">pressed</span> <span begin="00:59.947" end="01:00.268">up</span> <span begin="01:00.268" end="01:00.737">in</span> <span begin="01:00.737" end="01:01.152">the</span> <span begin="01:01.152" end="01:01.604">bath</span><span begin="01:01.604" end="01:02.099">room</span> <span begin="01:02.099" end="01:02.592">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在洗手间的排队队伍中紧紧相依</span></p><p begin="01:02.592" end="01:06.427" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:02.592" end="01:03.227">You</span> <span begin="01:03.227" end="01:03.529">looking</span> <span begin="01:03.529" end="01:03.761">like</span> <span begin="01:03.761" end="01:04.050">an</span> <span begin="01:04.050" end="01:04.509">angel</span> <span begin="01:04.509" end="01:04.740">on</span> <span begin="01:04.740" end="01:04.942">the</span> <span begin="01:04.942" end="01:05.152">walls</span> <span begin="01:05.152" end="01:05.370">of</span> <span begin="01:05.370" end="01:06.427">Versailles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你看起来就像凡尔赛宫墙上的天使</span></p><p begin="01:06.427" end="01:10.045" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:06.427" end="01:06.799">The</span> <span begin="01:06.799" end="01:07.147">most</span> <span begin="01:07.147" end="01:08.102">alive</span> <span begin="01:08.102" end="01:08.617">I've</span> <span begin="01:08.617" end="01:09.457">ever</span> <span begin="01:09.457" end="01:10.045">been</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是我此生感到最鲜活的时刻</span></p><p begin="01:10.045" end="01:14.118" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:10.045" end="01:10.523">But</span> <span begin="01:10.523" end="01:10.913">kiss</span> <span begin="01:10.913" end="01:11.461">me,</span> <span begin="01:11.461" end="01:11.926">and</span> <span begin="01:11.926" end="01:12.328">I</span> <span begin="01:12.328" end="01:12.753">might</span> <span begin="01:12.753" end="01:13.226">drop</span> <span begin="01:13.226" end="01:14.118">dead</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果你吻我，我也许会幸福得晕过去</span></p><p begin="01:21.781" end="01:23.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:21.781" end="01:21.853">And</span> <span begin="01:21.853" end="01:21.954">I</span> <span begin="01:21.954" end="01:22.111">feel</span> <span begin="01:22.111" end="01:22.246">like</span> <span begin="01:22.246" end="01:22.403">I</span> <span begin="01:22.403" end="01:22.521">might</span> <span begin="01:22.521" end="01:22.761">throw</span> <span begin="01:22.761" end="01:23.021">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那种感觉就像胃里在翻江倒海</span></p><p begin="01:23.536" end="01:25.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:23.536" end="01:23.735">Left</span> <span begin="01:23.735" end="01:23.971">hook,</span> <span begin="01:23.971" end="01:24.213">right</span> <span begin="01:24.213" end="01:24.423">punch</span> <span begin="01:24.423" end="01:24.618">to</span> <span begin="01:24.618" end="01:24.738">the</span> <span begin="01:24.738" end="01:25.160">gut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">像内心遭到重创</span></p><p begin="01:25.356" end="01:26.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:25.356" end="01:25.528">You're</span> <span begin="01:25.528" end="01:25.786">so,</span> <span begin="01:25.786" end="01:26.008">so</span> <span begin="01:26.008" end="01:26.378">pretty,</span> <span begin="01:26.378" end="01:26.826">boy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是个俊美无比的男孩</span></p><p begin="01:26.826" end="01:28.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:26.826" end="01:26.963">I'm</span> <span begin="01:26.963" end="01:27.173">pa</span><span begin="01:27.173" end="01:27.388">ra</span><span begin="01:27.388" end="01:27.698">noid</span> <span begin="01:27.698" end="01:27.855">I</span> <span begin="01:27.855" end="01:28.045">made</span> <span begin="01:28.045" end="01:28.293">you</span> <span begin="01:28.293" end="01:28.650">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我甚至开始怀疑你是否我幻想出来的</span></p><p begin="01:29.023" end="01:30.486" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:29.023" end="01:29.153">Yeah,</span> <span begin="01:29.153" end="01:29.249">I'd</span> <span begin="01:29.249" end="01:29.407">love</span> <span begin="01:29.407" end="01:29.539">it</span> <span begin="01:29.539" end="01:29.648">if</span> <span begin="01:29.648" end="01:29.771">you</span> <span begin="01:29.771" end="01:29.906">walked</span> <span begin="01:29.906" end="01:30.164">me</span> <span begin="01:30.164" end="01:30.486">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是啊，假如你能送我回家，我会很开心的</span></p><p begin="01:30.924" end="01:32.519" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:30.924" end="01:30.986">If</span> <span begin="01:30.986" end="01:31.074">you</span> <span begin="01:31.074" end="01:31.349">promise,</span> <span begin="01:31.349" end="01:31.474">we</span> <span begin="01:31.474" end="01:31.644">can</span> <span begin="01:31.644" end="01:31.829">go</span> <span begin="01:31.829" end="01:31.997">real</span> <span begin="01:31.997" end="01:32.519">slow</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果你能保证，我们可以走慢点</span></p><p begin="01:32.727" end="01:34.119" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:32.727" end="01:32.852">'Cause</span> <span begin="01:32.852" end="01:33.142">I</span> <span begin="01:33.142" end="01:33.341">got</span> <span begin="01:33.341" end="01:33.749">chewing</span> <span begin="01:33.749" end="01:34.119">gum</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为我带了口香糖</span></p><p begin="01:34.135" end="01:35.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:34.135" end="01:34.258">And</span> <span begin="01:34.258" end="01:34.395">a</span> <span begin="01:34.395" end="01:34.561">bunch</span> <span begin="01:34.561" end="01:34.713">of</span> <span begin="01:34.713" end="01:34.913">stuff</span> <span begin="01:34.913" end="01:35.061">I'd</span> <span begin="01:35.061" end="01:35.301">like</span> <span begin="01:35.301" end="01:35.543">to</span> <span begin="01:35.543" end="01:35.903">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还有一堆想了解你的事情</span></p><p begin="01:35.903" end="01:37.776" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:35.903" end="01:36.143">Like,</span> <span begin="01:36.381" end="01:36.506">have</span> <span begin="01:36.506" end="01:36.628">you</span> <span begin="01:36.628" end="01:36.883">ever</span> <span begin="01:36.883" end="01:37.066">been</span> <span begin="01:37.066" end="01:37.270">to</span> <span begin="01:37.270" end="01:37.776">Japan?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">比如，你有没有去过日本？</span></p><p begin="01:37.776" end="01:39.641" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:37.776" end="01:37.958">Or</span> <span begin="01:37.958" end="01:38.173">taken</span> <span begin="01:38.173" end="01:38.378">that</span> <span begin="01:38.378" end="01:39.101">Eurostar</span> <span begin="01:39.101" end="01:39.323">to</span> <span begin="01:39.323" end="01:39.641">France?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">或者坐过那趟去法国的欧洲之星列车？</span></p><p begin="01:40.085" end="01:41.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:40.085" end="01:40.218">I've</span> <span begin="01:40.218" end="01:40.353">been</span> <span begin="01:40.353" end="01:40.645">dropping</span> <span begin="01:40.645" end="01:40.883">hints</span> <span begin="01:40.883" end="01:41.116">all</span> <span begin="01:41.116" end="01:41.421">night</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">或者坐过那趟去法国的欧洲之星列车？</span></p><p begin="01:41.481" end="01:43.561" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:41.481" end="01:41.489">That</span> <span begin="01:41.489" end="01:41.571">I'd</span> <span begin="01:41.571" end="01:41.692">love</span> <span begin="01:41.692" end="01:41.849">it</span> <span begin="01:41.849" end="01:41.986">if</span> <span begin="01:41.986" end="01:42.114">you</span> <span begin="01:42.114" end="01:42.252">held</span> <span begin="01:42.252" end="01:42.472">my</span> <span begin="01:42.472" end="01:42.787">hand,</span> <span begin="01:42.787" end="01:42.996">god</span><span begin="01:42.996" end="01:43.561">damn</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">或者坐过那趟去法国的欧洲之星列车？</span></p><p begin="01:43.768" end="01:45.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:43.768" end="01:43.821">And</span> <span begin="01:43.821" end="01:43.926">then</span> <span begin="01:43.926" end="01:44.168">maybe</span> <span begin="01:44.168" end="01:44.303">we</span> <span begin="01:44.303" end="01:44.426">could</span> <span begin="01:44.426" end="01:44.688">make-</span><span begin="01:44.688" end="01:45.300">makeout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然后也许我们可以亲吻、亲热</span></p><p begin="01:45.523" end="01:46.991" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:45.523" end="01:45.753">Clothes</span> <span begin="01:45.753" end="01:46.013">off</span> <span begin="01:46.013" end="01:46.140">and</span> <span begin="01:46.140" end="01:46.438">fall</span> <span begin="01:46.438" end="01:46.578">to</span> <span begin="01:46.578" end="01:46.694">the</span> <span begin="01:46.694" end="01:46.991">ground</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">脱掉外衣，一起倒在地上</span></p><p begin="01:47.168" end="01:48.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:47.168" end="01:47.268">Let's</span> <span begin="01:47.268" end="01:47.523">go</span> <span begin="01:47.523" end="01:48.071">steady,</span> <span begin="01:48.071" end="01:48.231">let's</span> <span begin="01:48.231" end="01:48.493">go</span> <span begin="01:48.493" end="01:48.783">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让我们正式交往吧，约会吧</span></p><p begin="01:48.840" end="01:50.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:48.840" end="01:48.977">And</span> <span begin="01:48.977" end="01:49.207">tell</span> <span begin="01:49.207" end="01:49.390">the<