>in</span> <span begin="03:20.749" end="03:21.235">the</span> <span begin="03:21.235" end="03:21.690">bath</span><span begin="03:21.690" end="03:22.176">room</span> <span begin="03:22.176" end="03:22.661">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在洗手间的排队队伍中紧紧相依</span></p><p begin="03:22.661" end="03:26.419" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="03:22.661" end="03:23.068">You</span> <span begin="03:23.068" end="03:23.570">looking</span> <span begin="03:23.570" end="03:23.791">like</span> <span begin="03:23.791" end="03:24.003">an</span> <span begin="03:24.003" end="03:24.498">angel</span> <span begin="03:24.498" end="03:24.761">on</span> <span begin="03:24.761" end="03:24.968">the</span> <span begin="03:24.968" end="03:25.251">walls</span> <span begin="03:25.251" end="03:25.446">of</span> <span begin="03:25.446" end="03:26.419">Versailles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你看起来就像凡尔赛宫墙上的天使</span></p><p begin="03:26.419" end="03:30.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="03:26.419" end="03:26.852">The</span> <span begin="03:26.852" end="03:27.292">most</span> <span begin="03:27.292" end="03:28.253">alive</span> <span begin="03:28.253" end="03:28.669">I've</span> <span begin="03:28.669" end="03:29.498">ever</span> <span begin="03:29.498" end="03:30.083">been</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是我此生感到最鲜活的时刻</span></p><p begin="03:30.083" end="03:34.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="03:30.083" end="03:30.520">But</span> <span begin="03:30.520" end="03:30.962">kiss</span> <span begin="03:30.962" end="03:31.375">me</span> <span begin="03:31.375" end="03:31.830">and</span> <span begin="03:31.830" end="03:32.312">I</span> <span begin="03:32.312" end="03:34.200">might—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果你吻我，我可能会——</span></p><p begin="03:34.200" end="03:37.895" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="03:34.200" end="03:34.672">Kiss</span> <span begin="03:34.672" end="03:35.139">me,</span> <span begin="03:35.139" end="03:35.565">and</span> <span begin="03:35.565" end="03:36.018">I</span> <span begin="03:36.018" end="03:37.895">might—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你吻我，我可能会——</span></p><p begin="03:37.895" end="03:42.017" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54"><span begin="03:37.895" end="03:38.367">Kiss</span> <span begin="03:38.367" end="03:38.859">me,</span> <span begin="03:38.859" end="03:39.285">and</span> <span begin="03:39.285" end="03:39.772">I</span> <span begin="03:39.772" end="03:40.185">might</span> <span begin="03:40.185" end="03:40.603">drop</span> <span begin="03:40.603" end="03:42.017">dead</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但如果你吻我，我也许会幸福得晕过去</span></p></div></body></tt>